.TH AVR\-CONFIG\-UNSET 1 "" "avr 0.1.2" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-config-unset \- Remove a configuration override.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr config unset
[OPTIONS] {org}
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a configuration override.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Available keys:
  org   Drop the stored default organization for the active host
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr config unset org
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIKEY\fR
(choices: org)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-config (1),
.BR avr-config-get (1),
.BR avr-config-list (1),
.BR avr-config-set (1)
